   "id": 6,
   "parent": 2,
   "text": "The council is launching an aggressive city-wide crackdown and will be issuing crippling, immediate fines for anyone with a bin out past 8am. It’s going to be an absolute disaster starting next month, so watch your back or you’ll be bankrupt.",
   "author": 28,
   "step": 2,
   "mutation": "exaggerate",
   "emotion": 3.9899999999999998,
   "extremity": 3.9699999999999998
  },
  {
   "id": 7,
   "parent": 3,
   "text": "The council is officially planning to hit us with massive fines if bins are out even a minute past 8am. They are clearly finding new ways to control every single thing we do!",
   "author": 44,
   "step": 2,
   "mutation": "exaggerate",
   "emotion": 3.17,
   "extremity": 3.4
  },
  {
   "id": 8,
   "parent": 4,
   "text": "The council is officially cracking down and will start issuing heavy fines for bins left out past 8am starting next month. We need to get this sorted immediately before we all get hit with penalties.",
   "author": 58,
   "step": 2,
   "mutation": "exaggerate",
   "emotion": 2.0200000000000005,
   "extremity": 1.9
  },
  {
   "id": 9,
   "parent": 3,
   "text": "I heard from Mrs. Gable that the council might start fining people $50 for leaving bins out after 8am. They already have enough ridiculous rules, so I’ll believe this one when I actually see it happen.",
   "author": 60,
   "step": 2,
   "mutation": "add_detail",
   "emotion": 1.1400000000000001,
   "extremity": 0.65
  },
  {
   "id": 10,
   "parent": 5,
   "text": "The council is officially cracking down and will be issuing heavy fines for any bins left on the sidewalk past 8am. They are rolling out even more aggressive restrictions starting immediately, so everyone needs to be extremely careful.",
